vi q1.yaml

:q!

In Vim, after you delete a line, you are still in Normal mode. You can’t type text yet.

To start typing again, you need to switch into Insert mode:

Press i → insert text at the cursor position
Press a → insert text after the cursor
Press o → open a new line below and start typing
Press O → open a new line above